  "mathematical_judgments": [
    "The public Schwartz bundle is the literal W built from proved smoothness and compact support.",
    "Genuine directional derivative words and exact Laplacian finite sums pay d and d² from actual J2/J4 operator-norm bounds. No assumed Laplacian estimate supplier.",
    "Actual normalizedFourth expansion uses tau=((2π)^2)^−1 and yields fixed factor(1+tau*d)^2 times the true J4 budget. No unnecessary tau≤1 estimate changes constants.",
    "All derivative words vanish off tsupportW; finite volume of fixed compact tsupportQ pays the actual squared integral and its square root.",
    "Public C=1+Cd*((1+tau*d)^2*C4)*sqrt(volume.real(tsupportQ)) is chosen before all Z,u0,rho0,R and uses only fixed Q,a,b,c,d and native normalized volume.",
    "Phase cap is required on the whole tsupportQ; positive character and all signed variable/exp-amplitude factors are retained. No arbitrary moving Q, atom amplitude, root mask or spectral bound is hidden."
  ],
